---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /fortune/
title: 線上求籤｜東津代天府靈帝殿
description: 東津代天府靈帝殿線上求籤，採六十甲子籤，誠心默念姓名與所求之事，擲筊獲聖筊後即可觀看籤詩。
firebase: true
headScripts:
  - https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2canvas/1.4.1/html2canvas.min.js
extraCss:
  - fortune.css
extraJs:
  - lunar.js
  - fortune.js
  - blessings.js
---

<section class="page-head" data-glyph="籤" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">心靈指引</div>
    <h2 class="title">線上求籤</h2>
    <p class="fortune-motto">心誠則靈</p>
    <p class="lede">本站採用民間流傳已久的「六十甲子籤」，誠心默念姓名與所求之事，擲筊獲聖筊確認後即可觀看籤詩。</p>

    <div class="fortune-card">
      <div class="fortune-datebar" id="fortuneDateBar"></div>

      <div class="fortune-step active" id="fortuneFormStep">
        <p class="fortune-intro">請先靜下心來，默念您的姓名、出生年月日、住址，並在心中誠心說明想請示的事情，再點選「開始求籤」。<br>心誠則靈，切勿心存嬉戲或反覆求問同一事。</p>
        <div class="fortune-field">
          <label for="fortuneName">您的稱呼（必填，僅顯示於畫面，不會被儲存）</label>
          <input type="text" id="fortuneName" placeholder="例如：王小姐" oninput="clearFieldError('fortuneName')">
          <div class="field-error" id="fortuneNameError">請先輸入您的稱呼，讓神明知道是誰誠心來求籤。</div>
        </div>

        <div class="fortune-field">
          <label>所求事項</label>
          <div class="matter-grid" id="matterGrid">
            <button type="button" class="matter-chip" data-value="事業" onclick="selectMatter(this)"><span class="matter-icon">💼</span><span>事業／工作</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="matter-chip" data-value="感情" onclick="selectMatter(this)"><span class="matter-icon">💞</span><span>感情／婚姻</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="matter-chip" data-value="健康" onclick="selectMatter(this)"><span class="matter-icon">🍃</span><span>健康</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="matter-chip" data-value="財運" onclick="selectMatter(this)"><span class="matter-icon">💰</span><span>財運</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="matter-chip" data-value="家運" onclick="selectMatter(this)"><span class="matter-icon">🏠</span><span>家運／平安</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="matter-chip" data-value="學業" onclick="selectMatter(this)"><span class="matter-icon">📖</span><span>學業／考試</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="matter-chip" data-value="其他" onclick="selectMatter(this)"><span class="matter-icon">✨</span><span>其他</span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="fortune-field" id="otherMatterWrap" style="display:none;margin-top:14px;">
            <label for="otherMatterInput">請簡述所求事項</label>
            <input type="text" id="otherMatterInput" placeholder="例如：搬家擇日、出行平安…" oninput="clearFieldError('otherMatterInput')">
            <div class="field-error" id="otherMatterError">選擇「其他」時，請簡述您想請示的事情。</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn" style="width:100%;margin-top:10px;" onclick="fortuneStart()">誠心開始求籤</button>
      </div>

      <div class="fortune-step" id="fortuneDrawStep">
        <p class="fortune-hint" id="fortuneDrawHint">請誠心默念您所求之事，接著點選籤筒抽籤。</p>
        <div class="stick-bucket" id="stickBucket" onclick="drawStick()">
          <div class="bucket-glow"></div>
          <div class="bucket-tip">點我求籤</div>
          <div class="bucket-body-wrap">
            <div class="stick-set">
              <div class="stick" style="left:20px;height:78px;--rot:-14deg;--delay:0s;"></div>
              <div class="stick" style="left:36px;height:84px;--rot:-6deg;--delay:.35s;"></div>
              <div class="stick" style="left:52px;height:88px;--rot:1deg;--delay:.7s;"></div>
              <div class="stick" style="left:68px;height:80px;--rot:8deg;--delay:.15s;"></div>
              <div class="stick" style="left:80px;height:74px;--rot:14deg;--delay:.5s;"></div>
              <div class="stick" style="left:58px;height:70px;--rot:-2deg;--delay:.9s;"></div>
              <div class="flying-stick" id="flyingStick"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bucket-rim"></div>
            <div class="bucket-body"><div class="bucket-label">籤</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn" id="drawStickBtn" onclick="drawStick()">點選籤筒抽籤</button>
      </div>

      <div class="fortune-step" id="fortuneConfirmStep">
        <p class="fortune-hint">您抽到：</p>
        <div class="drawn-number" id="drawnNumber">第 1 籤</div>
        <p class="fortune-hint">請點選「擲筊」，向神明擲筊請示是否為此籤。連續擲出聖筊即可觀看籤詩；若為笑筊或陰筊，請重新誠心求籤。</p>
        <div class="jiao-stage" id="jiaoStage">
          <div class="jiao-ground"></div>
          <div class="jiao-row" id="jiaoRow" onclick="throwJiao()">
            <div class="jiao-tip">點我擲筊</div>
            <div class="jiao-piece" id="jiao1"><div class="jiao-inner"><div class="jiao-face round-face"></div><div class="jiao-face flat-face"></div></div></div>
            <div class="jiao-piece" id="jiao2"><div class="jiao-inner"><div class="jiao-face round-face"></div><div class="jiao-face flat-face"></div></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="jiao-result" id="jiaoResultText"></div>
        <button class="btn" id="throwJiaoBtn" onclick="throwJiao()">擲筊</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" id="retryFortuneBtn" style="display:none;margin-left:10px;" onclick="retryFortune()">重新求籤</button>
      </div>

      <div class="fortune-step" id="fortuneResultStep">
        <div class="fortune-slip" id="fortuneSlip">
          <div class="slip-seal">靈<br>帝<br>殿<br>印</div>
          <div class="slip-temple-name">東津代天府靈帝殿</div>
          <p class="result-for" id="resultForWhom"></p>
          <div class="result-head">
            <div class="result-no" id="resultNo">第 1 籤　甲子</div>
            <div class="level-badge" id="resultLevel">上籤</div>
          </div>
          <div class="poem-lines" id="resultPoem"></div>
          <div class="slip-field"><b>聖意</b><span id="resultHoly"></span></div>
          <div class="slip-field"><b>解曰</b><span id="resultExplain"></span></div>
          <div class="slip-field"><b>白話參考</b><span class="result-note" id="resultNote"></span></div>
          <div class="aspect-grid" id="resultAspects"></div>
          <p class="slip-date" id="slipDate"></p>
        </div>
        <p class="fortune-disclaimer">籤詩內容為通行版本整理，僅供心靈參考與安定心神之用（待廟方校訂）。若遇重大人生抉擇，仍建議親自到廟裡誠心擲筊請示，或請教廟方人員詳細解籤。</p>
        <div class="result-actions">
          <button class="btn" onclick="resetFortune()">再求一支籤</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" onclick="printFortuneSlip()">列印籤詩</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" onclick="saveFortuneImage()">儲存圖片</button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="lookup-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">籤號查詢</div>
      <h3 class="lookup-title">直接查閱籤詩</h3>
      <p class="lookup-desc">已知籤號，可直接輸入 1–60 查看該籤詩全文與解說（此為查閱，非擲筊請示）。</p>
      <div class="lookup-form">
        <input type="number" id="lookupInput" min="1" max="60" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="輸入籤號 1–60">
        <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="lookupStick()">查詢</button>
      </div>
      <div class="lookup-result" id="lookupResult"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="blessing-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">祈福留言牆</div>
      <h3 class="lookup-title">點一盞心燈</h3>
      <p class="lookup-desc">寫下對家人、對自己的祈願。留言經廟方確認後會顯示於下方留言牆。請勿張貼廣告、他人個資或不當內容。</p>
      <form class="blessing-form" id="blessingForm">
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="稱呼（選填，例如：王小姐）" maxlength="20">
        <textarea name="text" rows="3" maxlength="200" placeholder="祈願內容（必填，200 字內）" required></textarea>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">誠心送出</button>
      </form>
      <p class="blessing-status" id="blessingStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <div class="blessing-pending admin-only block" id="blessingPending"></div>
      <div class="blessing-wall" id="blessingWall"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  window.__FORTUNE_STICKS__ = {{ fortuneSticks | dump | safe }};
</script>
